    "detailed_description": "As a veteran conductor traversing the IronLine you have been tasked with a final mission. The final station is on the brink of destruction and you are to deliver life-saving cargo.<br><br>The IronLine is a unforgiving and harsh environment crawled with bugs and other monstrosities. You have been given permission to use any means necessary to defend your cargo.<br><br>With turrets at your disposal you are to travel down the track disposing anything that dares to takes you cargo.<br>Place, upgrade or even change layouts to reach that final destination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Student Game</h2>Iron Line is proudly made over the span of 12 weeks by 9 second year students from Breda University of Applied Sciences.",
